sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Android app
  participant Gems
  participant Users
  participant RDB as Ratings DB
  participant GDB as Gems DB
  participant Feed as Live Feed

  U->>App: Choose 1–5 stars on a gem
  App->>Gems: PUT /gem/:pk/rating { stars } (Bearer JWT)
  Gems->>Users: reqJwt(req)
  Users-->>Gems: req.user
  alt stars not a whole number 1–5
    Gems-->>App: 400 { message: "Invalid stars." }
  else Valid
    Gems->>GDB: Gem exists?
    alt No such gem
      Gems-->>App: 404 { message: "No such Gem." }
    else Gem exists
      Gems->>RDB: Store the user's rating (replaces an earlier one)
      Gems->>RDB: Count and average this gem's ratings
      RDB-->>Gems: count, average
      Gems->>Gems: Recompute GemScore
      Gems->>GDB: Save rating totals and GemScore
      Gems->>Feed: publishGemUpdated(gem)
      Feed-->>Feed: Send { type: "gem.updated", gem } to apps whose area contains it
      Gems-->>App: 200 { stars, gem }
      App-->>U: Show the new GemScore
    end
  end
